@startuml autonomous-culture-boundary
title Autonomous Culture Boundary ; per ADR-ES-024 + CR-ES-024

skinparam monochrome true
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultTextAlignment center

class "Culture" as Cult
class "Autonomous Culture" as AuCult
class "Autonomous Organization" as AuOrg
class "Agentic Organization" as AgOrg
class "Autonomous Operations" as AuOp
class "Agentic Operations" as AgOp
class "Agent" as Ag

Cult <|-- AuCult : specializes

AuCult --> AuOrg : supports
AuCult --> AgOrg : supports
AuCult --> AuOp : supports
AuCult --> AgOp : supports
AuCult --> Ag : engages-with

note right of AuCult
  Per ADR-ES-024 section 5 + section 8:
  Autonomous Culture is NOT Agentic Culture (orthogonal)
  Autonomous Culture is NOT Autonomous Organization
  Autonomous Culture is NOT Autonomous Enterprise
  Autonomous Culture is NOT Autonomous Operations
  Autonomous Culture is NOT Autonomous Workflow
  Autonomous Culture is NOT AI Culture
  Autonomous Culture is NOT Automated Culture
end note

@enduml
